1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,878
For this last lab, open your AI tool and pick a career you're curious about.

2
00:00:04,918 --> 00:00:07,391
Ask it to map out a path to that career,

3
00:00:07,431 --> 00:00:08,784
including skills,

4
00:00:08,824 --> 00:00:10,949
steps, a rough timeline,

5
00:00:10,989 --> 00:00:13,352
and how AI may change the work.

6
00:00:13,392 --> 00:00:17,709
Read the plan slowly, and mark one thing that's actually useful.

7
00:00:17,749 --> 00:00:20,875
Now, become the expert on your own life.

8
00:00:20,915 --> 00:00:22,452
What did it miss?

9
00:00:22,492 --> 00:00:26,018
Your values, your finances, where you live,

10
00:00:26,058 --> 00:00:27,766
the people who support you.

11
00:00:27,806 --> 00:00:29,996
Is anything outdated or made up?

12
00:00:30,036 --> 00:00:34,037
Push back. Tell it what it missed, and ask what it's unsure about.

13
00:00:34,077 --> 00:00:37,452
Then, name one real human to check with.

14
00:00:37,492 --> 00:00:39,260
Write 2 things it got wrong,

15
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,937
and one thing to keep.

16
00:00:40,977 --> 00:00:45,664
AI can sketch a map, but you're the one walking the path.
